---@field validateEdi? aws.b2bi.X12ValidateEdi Specifies whether or not to validate the EDI for this X12 object: TRUE or FALSE. When enabled, this performs both standard EDI validation and applies any configured custom validation rules including element length constraints, code list validations, and element requirement checks. Validation results are returned in the response validation messages.
---@field controlNumbers? aws.b2bi.X12ControlNumbers Specifies control number configuration for outbound X12 EDI headers. These settings determine the starting values for interchange, functional group, and transaction set control numbers.
