---Represents a single validation rule that can be applied during X12 EDI processing. This is a union type that can contain one of several specific validation rule types: code list validation rules for modifying allowed element codes, element length validation rules for enforcing custom length constraints, or element requirement validation rules for changing mandatory/optional status. Each validation...
