---@field elementRequirementValidationRule? aws.b2bi.X12ElementRequirementValidationRule Specifies an element requirement validation rule that modifies whether a specific X12 element is required or optional within a segment. This rule provides flexibility to accommodate different trading partner requirements for element presence.

